==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s (800%) spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*10 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**1 [[Rain D.]] spawns.
**1 [[Li'l Gau (form 2) (Enemy)|Li'l Gau (form 2)]] spawns.
**2 [[Yurinchi (Enemy)|Yurinchis]] spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Stacking [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Lizard Cat]] or any other high range units will make quick work of this level. The Li'l Gaus are tanky and deal a handful of damage, but their range still makes them easy to beat.

